1074
01:06:21.400 --> 01:06:23.560 align:middle
<c.yellow>Shitstorm lostreten.</c>

1075
01:06:23.840 --> 01:06:26.680 align:middle
<c.cyan>Und das den anderen immer vorwirft.</c>

1076
01:06:29.800 --> 01:06:33.160 align:middle
